  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You inhale to scream out your pain as the fire wash over you, sucking the flames deep into your lungs…</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3) and @Condition[Fatigued] (3). You get to roll once every week for the next three weeks, a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test, to remove one @Condition[Fatigued] Condition. Failure makes one @Condition[Fatigued] Condition permanent as your lungs and airways scar and turn fibrous and stiff. Regardless, you also contract @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.M8XyRs9DN12XsFTQ]{Blood Rot} from pneumonia as bacteria thrive in your pus-filled airways.</p>"
    },
